    tutorial "Improving these will also unlock special rewards in specific situations throughout a character's story development"

# game/script/characters/violet/quests/violet_quest_0_a.rpy:82
translate english quest_violet_questprincipal_0_a_e1255e0a:

    # tutorial "La forma más directa de mejorarlos es usando la interaccion [colorear_quest('Hablar')] que veremos en el [colorear_quest('Menu del Personaje')] al hacerle click"
    tutorial "The most direct way to improve them is by using the [colorear_quest('Talk')] interaction we'll see in the [colorear_quest('Character Menu')] when we click on them"

# game/script/characters/violet/quests/violet_quest_0_a.rpy:83
translate english quest_violet_questprincipal_0_a_0278be23:

    # tutorial "Prueba [colorear_quest('Hablar con Violet')] para mejorar tu relación con ella"
